# Library module split recommendation (escalation)

Use when `repo_archetype=library_monorepo` or `ambiguous` and `plan_validation_failed=true`.

## Goal

Patch **existing** script-generated artifacts only — do not replace the catalog from training data.

## Allowed edits

- Add `architect_notes` / `tech_lead_notes` paragraphs in `service-catalog.yaml` comments or fields
- Refine `migration-phases.md` ordering narrative (must align with `coupling-matrix.json` `extraction_order`)
- `note(llm_patch_applied=true)` with list of paths touched

## Forbidden

- Inventing modules not in `boundary_scan.json`
- Changing `depends_on` arrays or `never_extract` without citing scan evidence
- `github_create_files` or Ubuntu `execute_series` recovery

When `repo_archetype=service_monorepo`, prefer strangler / contract-first language in patches only.
